  "description": "Vilano Blackjack 3.0 29er MTB handles trails, dirt paths, or the ride to work with ease. It has a hand-built hydroformed alloy frame. A larger 30.9mm diameter seat post saves weight, adds stiffness and gives more control on any ride. Mechanical front and rear disc brakes have great stopping power in any road or trail conditions. Large 29″ double walled alloy wheels and 29 x 2.1 tires will easily roll over obstacles. Now with 24 speeds and an upgraded drivetrain, this MTB has an 80mm travel suspension fork. Offered at an amazingly low price!\n\nThe all-new Vilano Blackjack 3.0 29er is a complete redesign. It’s equally at ease on the trail, dirt road & paths, or pavement. The frame is a lightweight, handcrafted 6061 aluminum, together with the suspension fork, they allow you to cruise over obstacles. The shifters provide, fast accurate shifting. The front and rear disc brakes provide plenty of stopping power in all conditions.\n\nAssembly and Tuning Required",
